src/convert/images.rs ports calibre's `fit_image` (src/calibre/__init__.py) and the steps of
`scale_image` (src/calibre/utils/img.py) that kfxgen's picture optimizer runs, under the same
notice. They were read at calibre commit ca05b8602e3e (v8.12.0-77); kfxgen runs under calibre
9.18.0, which was not compared. The size the picture is then drawn at follows the behaviour of
Qt's `QImage::scaled` with `Qt::KeepAspectRatio` (`QSize::scaled`); no Qt code is copied.

